siteconf is a configurable incremental build
script generator.  with the web preset (-P),
it is a very minimal static site generator
(if it even deserves to be called one.)

Since siteconf 0.03 (gengenlib 0.01 genlib 0.03),
perl 5.008 is required for Unicode support.
it is recommended to use at least perl 5.010
(since version.pm would be core by then).

WWW: https://foss.rapidcow.org/project/siteconf/
